-- Seed the Conquest + Siege map pools into prod. The deploy runs migrations but NOT the
-- seed, so without this a fresh prod has 0 Conquest/Siege maps and hosts cannot create those
-- tournaments (empty pool -> 422). New maps only, matched by unique slug: existing (Domination)
-- rows and any admin available/battle_type choices are left untouched. The local images
-- (/maps/*.png) ship with the frontend build, so image_url points straight at them.

ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;
